# Patterns are deliberately UNANCHORED (no leading slash) so they keep
# working wherever the app lives in the tree. They were anchored to the repo
# root once; moving the app into classic/ silently un-ignored 229 MB of Piper
# voice models, one of which is over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit — the
# push would have been rejected outright.
**/tools/.tts-key
**/tools/voices/
**/tools/verify-report.json
**/tools/audio-repair-report.json
**/tools/verify-phrases-report.json
**/recordings/
.venv-tts/
.work/
*.aiff
